  m_Name: Carta_ParqueUrbano
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Parque Urbano
  _titleEn: Urban Park
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Parques d\xE3o lazer, sombra e contato com a natureza, e muitos tamb\xE9m
    guardam a \xE1gua da chuva e evitam enchentes."
  _summaryEn: Parks offer leisure, shade and contact with nature, and many also hold
    rainwater and prevent floods.
  _realWorld: O Parque Barigui, em Curitiba, criado em 1972, tem um lago que ajuda
    a controlar as cheias do rio Barigui.
  _realWorldEn: Barigui Park in Curitiba, created in 1972, has a lake that helps
    control the floods of the Barigui River.
  _tradeOffs: "Parques custam manuten\xE7\xE3o e seguran\xE7a, e podem valorizar
    tanto o entorno que expulsam moradores antigos."
  _tradeOffsEn: Parks require upkeep and security, and can raise nearby property
    values so much that long-time residents are pushed out.
  _sources:
  - Label: "Parque Barigui (Wikip\xE9dia)"
    Url: https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Parque_Barigui
  - Label: OMS, Urban green spaces and health (2016)
    Url: https://www.who.int/europe/publications/i/item/WHO-EURO-2016-3352-43111-60341
